      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "男 三千二百二十八人〕"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Male: 3,228 persons as printed (the closing brace of the shizoku group prints at the foot of this pair). Every other figure on the leaf implies 3,728 here: the combined shizoku-and-sotsu male count of 8,604 less the sotsu male count of 4,876 leaves 3,728, and 3,728 plus the printed female 3,529 gives exactly the printed shizoku total of 7,257. The leaf nevertheless prints 二 in the hundreds place, so 3,228 is recorded as printed and the 500 gap is an error in the source."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "士族人口内男"
